<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes REIT started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Lakes REIT started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Great Lakes REIT Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates funds from operations at $1.48 per share in 1997 and $1.69 per share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of 18-1/2, which Lehman said was based on applying peer average multiple of 10.9 to 1998 funds from operations estimate.</p>
</text>
